# Per-user Claude Code state (worktrees, local settings) — but the project skills in
# .claude/skills/ are part of the repo: they are for people working ON damson, who by
# definition have the clone. A directory pattern blocks descent, so this excludes the
# CONTENTS and re-includes the one subtree that ships.
.claude/*
!.claude/skills/
__pycache__/
